NsinfoTradTab = Automatic translation
NsinfoTradIntro = Choose a translation API: a "Translate" button appears next to each field to translate. The source language is the language of the user; the translated text fills the field (to save with Update).
NsinfoTradProvider = Translation API
NsinfoTradNone = (none)
NsinfoTradKey = API key
NsinfoTradKeyDeepl = Authentication key of the DeepL API (DeepL API Free or Pro account, Account page)
NsinfoTradKeyGoogle = API key of a Google Cloud project where the Cloud Translation API is enabled (billing must be enabled on the project)
NsinfoTradKeyAzure = Key of the Translator resource (Azure Portal > Keys and Endpoint)
NsinfoTradKeyLibre = API key: required on libretranslate.com, optional on a self-hosted instance (depends on its setup)
NsinfoTradPlan = Plan
